## Background

MCP `2026-07-28` RC — largest revision since launch. Final spec ships July 28, 2026.
https://blog.modelcontextprotocol.io/posts/2026-07-28-release-candidate/

Draft: https://modelcontextprotocol.io/specification/draft

## Required (breaking)

1. Remove `initialize`/`initialized` handshake; clientInfo, capabilities, protocolVersion move into `_meta` on every request — [SEP-2575](https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol/pull/2575)
2. Remove `Mcp-Session-Id` header and protocol-level session — [SEP-2567](https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol/pull/2567)
3. Send `Mcp-Method` + `Mcp-Name` headers on Streamable HTTP — [SEP-2243](https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol/pull/2243)
4. Send `MCP-Protocol-Version` header — implied by stateless core
5. Add `server/discover` method — [SEP-2575](https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol/pull/2575)

## Recommended

6. Validate OAuth `iss` (RFC 9207) — [SEP-2468](https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol/pull/2468)
7. Send `application_type` in Dynamic Client Registration — [SEP-837](https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol/pull/837)
8. Display JSON Schema 2020-12 constructs in `mcpx info` — [SEP-2106](https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol/pull/2106)
9. Cache `tools/list` via `ttlMs`/`cacheScope` — [SEP-2549](https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol/pull/2549)

## Out of scope

- Roots / Sampling / Logging deprecation ([SEP-2577](https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol/pull/2577)) — not in mcpx
- MCP Apps / Tasks extensions — opt-in